###

### AI Counselor Chat (Initial Query)
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "I am worried about my grades, what should I do?",
    "student_context": {
        "Enrollment_ID": "STU98765",
        "CGPA": 4.2,
        "risk_label": "critical",
        "Fees_Status": "Pending"
    }
}

###

### AI Counselor Chat (With History)
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "What is the syllabus for Engineering Mathematics?",
    "student_context": {
        "Enrollment_ID": "STU98765",
        "CGPA": 4.2,
        "risk_label": "critical",
        "Fees_Status": "Pending"
    },
    "history": [
        {"role": "user", "content": "What is Engineering Mathematics?"},
        {"role": "assistant", "content": "Engineering Mathematics is a branch of applied mathematics concerning mathematical methods and techniques that are typically used in engineering and industry."}
    ]
}
